   \]

2. **Calculate the total loading dose in mg**:
   \[
   \text{Loading dose} = \text{Dose per kg} \times \text{Weight in kg} = 20 \text{ mg/kg} \times 14.5 \text{ kg} = 280 \text{ mg}
