\[
\text{R}_1 \text{OH} + \text{R}_2) \text{CH}_2 \text{CHO} \rightarrow \text{R}_1 \text{OH} \text{CH}_2 \text{COCH}_2 \text{R}_2 + \text{H}_2\text{O}
\]
where \( R_1 \) and \( R_2 \) are alkyl or aryl groups.

