   \]
   Substituting \(\frac{\partial \phi}{\partial t} = \frac{\phi_{j+1} - \phi_{j-1}}{2\Delta t}\), and \(\frac{\partial \phi}{\partial x} = \frac{\phi_{j+1} - \phi_{j-1}}{2\Delta x}\), the original equation becomes:
   \[
